    "html": "<p>Two identical waves meet and interfere constructively. The intensity of each wave is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I\"></span> and the amplitude of each wave is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span>. What are the intensity and the amplitude of the resultant wave?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Intensity</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Amplitude</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2I\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2A\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4I\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4A\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4I\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2A\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2I\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4A\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
